缩更多参与血块收缩。"],"transfer_rule":"血小板题分阶段：胶原/vWF负责黏附起步，ADP+TXA₂负责放大聚集。","mapping_decision":"NEEDS_CHAT_MAPPING_REVIEW","upgrade_decision":"NO_CHANGE","review":{"semantic_owner":"Chat","format":"FAST_OWNER","learner_state_included":false,"old_explanation_inherited":false}},{"question_id":"xizong-official-2017-n004","truth_gate":"PASS","explanation_status":"APPROVED","question_truth_ref":{"path":"content/xizong/questions/shards/2017/q001-025.json","blob_sha":"e6b9f0c17aa16c01b92c11026977f25dfb750449","source_status":"CURRENT_FORMAL_QUESTION_TRUTH"},"exam_target":"窦房结起搏细胞电生理","decision_axis":"窦房结细胞最大舒张电位绝对值较小，4期自动去极化；其0期主要由Ca²⁺内流形成而不是快Na⁺内流。","reasoning_chain":["窦房结没有心室肌那样稳定、很负的静息电位，而是最大舒张电位较浅，因此绝对值较小，B正确。","窦房结0期由L型Ca²⁺通道主导，去极化速度慢，所以A错误，也不会按快Na⁺通道模式被河豚毒素阻断，C错误。","窦房结4期存在自动去极化，正是其自律性的基础；心室肌4期则相对稳定，因此D也不对。"],"transfer_rule":"窦房结记“电位浅、0期慢Ca、4期自动爬坡”；心室肌记“0期快Na、4期稳定”。","mapping_decision":"NEEDS_CHAT_MAPPING_REVIEW","upgrade_decision":"NO_CHANGE","review":{"semantic_owner":"Chat","format":"FAST_OWNER","learner_state_included":false,"old_explanation_inherited":false}},{"question_id":"xizong-official-2017-n005","truth_gate":"PASS","explanation_status":"APPROVED","question_truth_ref":{"path":"content/xizong/questions/shards/2017/q001-025.json","blob_sha":"e6b9f0c17aa16c01b92c11026977f25dfb750449","source_status":"CURRENT_FORMAL_QUESTION_TRUTH"},"exam_target":"主动脉瓣关闭时相","decision_axis":"射血结束后左室压降至低于主动脉压，主动脉瓣随即关闭，等容舒张期由此开始。","reasoning_chain":["心室射血需要左室压高于主动脉压；当左室开始舒张、压力降到主动脉压以下时，血液短暂回流趋势使主动脉瓣关闭。","此时二尖瓣尚未开放，心室所有瓣膜都关闭而容积不变，因此进入等容舒张期。","所以主动脉瓣开始关闭的瞬间对应等容舒张期初，选D。"],"transfer_rule":"半月瓣关闭＝射血结束＝等容舒张开始；房室瓣开放才进入快速充盈。","mapping_decision":"NEEDS_CHAT_MAPPING_REVIEW","upgrade_decision":"NO_CHANGE","review":{"semantic_owner":"Chat","format":"FAST_OWNER","learner_state_included":false,"old_explanation_inherited":false}},{"question_id":"xizong-official-2017-n006","truth_gate":"PASS","explanation_status":"APPROVED","question_truth_ref":{"path":"content/xizong/questions/shards/2017/q001-025.json"