9","source_status":"CURRENT_FORMAL_QUESTION_TRUTH"},"exam_target":"食物氧热价定义","decision_axis":"氧热价表示某营养物氧化时每消耗1 L氧所释放的热量。","reasoning_chain":["按题干与选项，依据上述判断轴确定题源答案。"],"transfer_rule":"氧热价表示某营养物氧化时每消耗1 L氧所释放的热量。","mapping_decision":"NEEDS_CHAT_MAPPING_REVIEW","upgrade_decision":"NO_CHANGE","review":{"semantic_owner":"Chat","format":"FAST_OWNER","learner_state_included":false,"old_explanation_inherited":false}},{"question_id":"xizong-official-2017-n010","truth_gate":"PASS","explanation_status":"APPROVED","question_truth_ref":{"path":"content/xizong/questions/shards/2017/q001-025.json","blob_sha":"e6b9f0c17aa16c01b92c11026977f25dfb750449","source_status":"CURRENT_FORMAL_QUESTION_TRUTH"},"exam_target":"高钾摄入后的肾排钾","decision_axis":"摄入K⁺增多后，远曲小管和集合管主细胞K⁺分泌增强；血K⁺升高还可促进醛固酮分泌，进一步促进排钾。","reasoning_chain":["肾脏调节K⁺排泄的可变环节主要在远端肾单位，尤其远曲小管和集合管的K⁺分泌。","高K⁺摄入使血K⁺升高并刺激醛固酮，促进主细胞ENaC/Na⁺-K⁺泵轴工作，使K⁺分泌增加，因此A正确。","近端小管K⁺重吸收不是这类快速调节的主环节；醛固酮不是减少而是增加；GFR变化也不是主要机制。"],"transfer_rule":"排钾调节抓远端：血K⁺↑/醛固酮↑ → 远曲小管、集合管K⁺分泌↑。","mapping_decision":"NEEDS_CHAT_MAPPING_REVIEW","upgrade_decision":"NO_CHANGE","review":{"semantic_owner":"Chat","format":"FAST_OWNER","learner_state_included":false,"old_explanation_inherited":false}},{"question_id":"xizong-official-2017-n011","truth_gate":"PASS","explanation_status":"APPROVED","question_truth_ref":{"path":"content/xizong/questions/shards/2017/q001-025.json","blob_sha":"e6b9f0c17aa16c01b92c11026977f25dfb750449","source_status":"CURRENT_FORMAL_QUESTION_TRUTH"},"exam_target":"尿浓缩稀释的ADH调节","decision_axis":"ADH调节集合管水通透性，是机体最终浓缩或稀释尿液的关键体液因子。","reasoning_chain":["按题干与选项，依据上述判断轴确定题源答案。"],"transfer_rule":"ADH调节集合管水通透性，是机体最终浓缩或稀释尿液的关键体液因子。","mapping_decision":"NEEDS_CHAT_MAPPING_REVIEW","upgrade_decision":"NO_CHANGE","review":{"semantic_owner":"Chat","format":"FAST_OWNER","learner_state_included":false,"old_explanation_inherited":false}},{"question_id":"xizong-official-2017-n012","truth_gate":"PASS","explanation_status":"APPROVED","question_truth_ref":{"path":"content/xizo